      "message": "Delete this step.  The Zephyr drivers do not provide support for this.  By default, the Zephyr keyboard drivers will automatically invert column 2.\n\nIf a different pin is connected to the refresh key, then the board can set the devicetree alias \"gpio-kbd-kso2\" to the correct pin.\n\nFor example:\n```\naliases {\n    gpio-kbd-kso2 \u003d gpio_ec_kso_02_inv; /* Normal case, use column 2 */\n    gpio-kbd-kso2 \u003d gpio_ec_kso_04_inv; /* Use column 4 for refresh key */\n    \n```",
